    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/ExampleMatcher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>ExampleMatcher</code></a> implementation for query by example (QBE). Unlike plain <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/ExampleMatcher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>ExampleMatcher</code></a> this untyped\ncounterpart does not enforce type matching when executing the query. This allows to query unrelated example documents\nas references for querying collections as long as the used field/property names match.",
      "translation": "用于通过示例（QBE）查询的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/ExampleMatcher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>ExampleMatcher</code></a>实现。与普通的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/ExampleMatcher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>ExampleMatcher</code></a>不同，这个非类型化的对应版本在执行查询时不强制进行类型匹配。这使得只要使用的字段/属性名称相匹配，就可以将无关的示例文档作为参考来查询集合。",
      "count": 1
    },
